OL,3,ATrump pushes Apple to change 'Lake
OL,4,AOntario' to 'Lake America' on its maps
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has asked
OL,7,Ftech firm Apple to rename Lake Ontario
OL,8,Fas Lake America on its Maps platform to
OL,9,Fcomply with his executive order
OL,10,Fchanging the name of the Great Lake,
OL,11,FInterior Secretary Doug Burgum has
OL,12,Fsaid.
OL,14,FBurgum told Fox Business' Mornings with
OL,15,FMaria programme on Monday that "the
OL,16,Fpresident has reached out to Apple
OL,17,Fdirectly", adding: "I'm sure we may be
OL,18,Fseeing that change coming up soon."
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
